<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="color-scheme" content="light">
<meta name="supported-color-schemes" content="light">
<title>Reset your LibraryZ password</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#f3efe7;">
<div style="display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;color:#f3efe7;font-size:1px;line-height:1px;">Use this link within {{.Lifetime}} to choose a new password.</div>
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background-color:#f3efe7;">
<tr><td align="center" style="padding:32px 16px;">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="max-width:520px;">
<tr><td style="padding:0 4px 16px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:600;color:#1d1c18;">Library<span style="color:#2e5e4e;">Z</span></td></tr>
<tr><td style="background-color:#fbf8f2;border:1px solid #cdc8bc;border-radius:14px;padding:32px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#1d1c18;">
<h1 style="margin:0 0 20px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:24px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:600;color:#1d1c18;">Reset your password</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;">Hi {{.DisplayName}},</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 24px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;">We received a request to reset the password for your LibraryZ account, <strong style="font-weight:600;">{{.Email}}</strong>. To choose a new password, use the button below within {{.Lifetime}}.</p>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:0 0 24px;"><tr>
<td style="border-radius:28px;background-color:#2e5e4e;"><a href="{{.Link}}" style="display:inline-block;padding:14px 26px;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.2;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:28px;">Choose a new password</a></td>
</tr></table>
<p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:#4a4740;">Using the LibraryZ app? Choose “Forgot password?”, then “Have a code?”, and enter:</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 24px;font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:0.04em;color:#1d1c18;background-color:#f0ece3;border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px;word-break:break-all;">{{.Code}}</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:#4a4740;">The link and code work once. If you ask again, we'll send a new one and this one will stop working. Choosing a new password signs you out on every device.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 24px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:#4a4740;">If you didn't ask to reset your password, you can ignore this email. Your password stays the same.</p>
<p style="margin:0;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #cdc8bc;font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;color:#4a4740;">Button not working? Copy this address into your browser:<br><a href="{{.Link}}" style="color:#2e5e4e;word-break:break-all;">{{.Link}}</a></p>
</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:16px 4px 0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;color:#4a4740;">{{if .CanReply}}Questions? Reply to this email.<br>{{end}}You're getting this email because a password reset was requested for {{.Email}} on LibraryZ.</td></tr>
</table>
</td></tr>
</table>
</body>
</html>
